\section{Cellular Metabolic Substrate: Coupled ODE/PDE System}

ATP dynamics:
\[
\frac{\partial \text{ATP}}{\partial t}
= \alpha_{\text{mito}} G O_2
- \beta_{\text{load}} f
- \gamma_{\text{use}} \text{ATP}
+ \Phi_{\text{shunt}}(\mathbf{x},t).
\]

Glucose and oxygen transport:
\begin{align}
\frac{\partial G}{\partial t}
&= D_G \nabla^2 G - \rho_G(\mathbf{x},t), \\
\frac{\partial O_2}{\partial t}
&= D_{O_2} \nabla^2 O_2 - \rho_{O_2}(\mathbf{x},t).
\end{align}

Inflammatory cytokine dynamics:
\[
\frac{\partial I_{\text{inflam}}}{\partial t}
= \sigma_f f
- \delta_{\text{resolve}} I_{\text{inflam}}
- \nu_{\text{suppress}}(\mathbf{x},t)\, I_{\text{inflam}}.
\]

