\section{Network and Organoid Neural Field Dynamics}

Neural field equation:
\[
\tau \frac{\partial V(\mathbf{r},t)}{\partial t}
= -V(\mathbf{r},t)
+ \int_{\Omega_r} W(\mathbf{r},\mathbf{r}')\, 
\phi(V(\mathbf{r}',t))\, d\mathbf{r}'
+ I_{\text{ext}}(\mathbf{r},t).
\]

Synaptic integrity evolution:
\[
\frac{\partial S(\mathbf{r},t)}{\partial t}
= -\lambda_{\text{degen}} f(\mathbf{r},t) S(\mathbf{r},t)
+ \eta_{\text{repair}}(\mathbf{r},t)\, (1 - S(\mathbf{r},t)).
\]

Global fidelity invariant:
\[
F_{\text{synapse}}
= \frac{1}{|\Omega_r|} \int_{\Omega_r} S(\mathbf{r},t)\, d\mathbf{r}
> 1 - 10^{-8}.
\]

