\section{Global Lyapunov Eradication Functional}

Define:
\[
\mathcal{L}(t)
= \alpha_1 \int_{\Omega} f(\mathbf{x},t)\, d\mathbf{x}
+ \alpha_2 \int_{\Omega} I_{\text{inflam}}(\mathbf{x},t)\, d\mathbf{x}
- \alpha_3 \int_{\Omega_r} S(\mathbf{r},t)\, d\mathbf{r}.
\]

Eradication condition:
\[
\frac{d\mathcal{L}}{dt} < 0,
\qquad
\lim_{t\to\infty} \mathcal{L}(t) = 0.
\]

